# SitGuru Admin workplace look

Admin HQ must match Manager / Intern desk portals — cool gray canvas, blue active rail, soft cards — not the old pale green-slate shell or white “command center” walls.

## Shell (layout)
- `app/admin/layout.tsx` uses `DESK_UI` / `DESK_LOGO` / `DESK_BANNER` from `@/lib/portal/desk-ui`.
- Page bg `#F4F7FB`, white rail, active nav `#2563EB`, wordmark with `mix-blend-multiply`.
- Keep SitGuru green `#0D5C3A` for brand CTAs (Social Media Manager), not as the shell fill.

## Page chrome
- Prefer `GrowthPageFrame` with `variant="desk"` (pastel sky→violet header) for HQ homes and queues.
- Green header `#0D5C3A` (`variant="green"`) is OK for brand-heavy workplaces; always `public-dark-section` / `data-brand-green` and `!text-white` on titles. Never dark text on brand green.
- Color KPI tiles via desk tints / `AdminThemeCard` (emerald / sky / amber / rose / violet / slate).
- Big action tiles via `AdminWorkplaceActions` — icon, short label, one-line detail.
- Work queues and lists live in `GrowthCard` / `AdminWorkplaceCard` (slate soft border + light shadow).
- Source health is a compact footer (`AdminWorkplaceHealth`), not a second hero.

## Do not ship
- Pale gradient “Pathways Command Center” heroes
- 12–16 identical white module cards with Live/Next badges
- Eight tiny white metric tiles in one row
- Long technical copy as the first thing on the page
- Grids that overflow the admin pane — use `min-w-0`, wrap text, stack before `xl`
- Green-800 shell / nav that diverges from Manager / Intern desk tokens

## Copy
- Punchy workplace titles (“Turn X into Y”), not department slogans.
- Keep contractor / SkillBridge / Checkr legal notes short and in a notes card.
